Bundled datasets
----------------

Datasets under `rcopula/datasets/` are redistributed for reproducibility of the
worked examples. Each carries its original source citation in
`rcopula/datasets/SOURCES.md`. They originate from published academic work and
are included under the same terms as their original publication.
